-- Codec `51` is not a DASL codec, whatever the hash.
example : [0xD8, 0x2A, 0x58, 0x25, 0x00, 0x01, 0x51, 0x12, 0x20, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00] ∉ language .drislBdaslExactCid := by decide +kernel
